# Pilotbook

This is the Pilotbook source tree. Use `pnpm pb`, not `npx pilotbook`. Work items live as markdown with YAML frontmatter. Do not move files to change status.

Load the explore/ship router, then one skill:

```bash
pnpm pb instructions overview
pnpm pb skill discover
```

Follow that router. Linked BR-/ADR- files win over improvisation. `pnpm pb lint` must exit 0. Never invent IDs — use `pnpm pb new`.
